-friendly and efficient, allowing customers to easily book appointments and purchase COVID tests online.",{"id":63,"comp_type":50,"comp_var":64,"imgs":65},"grid2","triple",[66,69,70],{"ruta":67,"alt":68},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732384163/procor_shop-laptop_bhvszw_c_crop_ar_4_3_mshzvh.png","Procorlab shop on laptop",{"ruta":54,"alt":55},{"ruta":71,"alt":72},"https://res.cloudinary.com/df5xojjiw/image/upload/v1732383104/procor_hero-iphone_dsxcwj_c_crop_ar_9_16_bo6q2r.png","Procorlab homepage on iPhone",{"comp_type":74,"comp_var":75,"link":76,"description":77,"imgs":78},"related","project","/projects/wave-maps","Wave maps",[79],{"ruta":80,"alt":81},"/img/wavemaps.jpg","",true,"/projects/procorlab",{},"projects/procorlab","DEo6Y06iDP0JVeI8g1ap9w5jEDl7GDqmwNCiB6bk7Ho",1777359078672]